WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,780 --> 00:00:01,860
you are very smart

2
00:00:02,380 --> 00:00:03,380
but smart people

3
00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:05,460
It usually doesn't end well

4
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:12,020
You are right

5
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:15,590
The rumors are true

6
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:17,920
I am fake

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,850
Little ones don’t know anything

8
00:00:23,850 --> 00:00:25,410
heard nothing

9
00:00:25,810 --> 00:00:27,290
Then the moral boy used a pseudonym

10
00:00:27,290 --> 00:00:28,290
But I have found out

11
00:00:28,290 --> 00:00:29,410
His name is Gu Shiyi

12
00:00:29,410 --> 00:00:32,010
I live in a thatched house near the racecourse in Baici Town, right?

13
00:00:32,010 --> 00:00:34,130
He is still the one who has been in the limelight recently.

14
00:00:34,130 --> 00:00:35,650
Seventeen years old seven point five

15
00:00:35,890 --> 00:00:45,130
You shopkeeper

16
00:00:45,450 --> 00:00:48,330
It’s okay if you haven’t been to the Fu family branch hall.

17
00:00:48,570 --> 00:00:49,730
suffered something

18
00:00:50,170 --> 00:00:51,330
Have you seen anyone

19
00:00:51,530 --> 00:00:54,570
Mr. Qiu, let me have a chance to live.

20
00:00:54,570 --> 00:00:56,130
The little ones only know so much

21
00:00:56,330 --> 00:00:58,010
Mr. Qiu, let me go back

22
00:00:58,950 --> 00:01:00,710
