23
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:05,870
I will never contact the Gu family again, but

24
00:01:06,310 --> 00:01:07,710
you can still talk

25
00:01:14,610 --> 00:01:15,730
you are very smart

26
00:01:16,170 --> 00:01:17,170
but smart

27
00:01:18,070 --> 00:01:19,710
Often they don’t live long

28
00:01:30,930 --> 00:01:32,450
Even without tongue

29
00:01:33,430 --> 00:01:35,150
But you can still write

30
00:01:35,510 --> 00:01:37,430
Cut off my right hand and left hand

31
00:01:37,630 --> 00:01:39,350
I cut off my left hand and feet.

32
00:01:39,980 --> 00:01:41,660
My arms and legs are gone and I still have a mouth.

33
00:01:42,060 --> 00:01:44,900
If a living person really wants to reveal some secret

34
00:01:45,220 --> 00:01:46,740
There are always countless ways

35
00:01:46,740 --> 00:01:48,100
are you right
